# Tribute mini · garran (Garran, the Last Wall, GIANT) · built 2026-11-03 from uploads/Dayne_tts.obj (Mini Baker, Y-up, faced +Z, no base)
# GIANT tri-hex base + facing marker copied from minis/aykin (three 2" hexes, lip y 0.10); UVs moved to a flat 230-grey patch of this diffuse/normal (u 0.9775, v 0.6328, 40 px). g base FIRST (player tint), g figure untinted.
# body: turned 180 deg to face -Z, feet centre (4.85, -0.47) = midpoint of both feet on the base centroid, ground y 0.096, scaled x0.11644: crown (helm top) 4.65" like Aykin, horn tips 5.19".
